  {
   "section": "container-light",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "The ELT will have a pioneering five-mirror optical design that will allow it to unveil the Universe in unprecedented detail. The mirrors – M1, M2, M3, M4 and M5 – all have different shapes, sizes and roles but will work together seamlessly to deliver observations with more clarity than ever before."
    }
   ],
   "imgCount": 0,
