  {
   "section": "container-light",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "The ELT will employ sophisticated 'adaptive optics' technologies to compensate for the turbulence of the Earth’s atmosphere and to ensure its images are sharper than those of any other telescope. It will also have other components such as a prefocal station that works as the link between the telescope and its instruments. Finally, it will have a modern control system to allow the user to operate the telescope for science observations and maintenance activities."
    }
   ],
